  "regressions": {
    "field": "RC5: nine client accounts fail at DATA cursor/count 32 during CLOSE, despite low direct IMAP latency.",
    "before": "Frozen RC5 stalls during verified download and times out before upload; silent half-closed origin blocks replacement; idle DNS associations can reject TCP workers.",
    "after": "RC6 completes verified 24 MiB download, fresh-TLS upload and post-reconnect download with CLOSE stalled; also survives all cleanup stalled with one isolated attempt and no failed accounts. Native SOCKS/TUN handles 32 fresh HTTPS posts alongside 128 DNS association attempts and 16 incomplete TLS sockets.",
    "intermediate_failure": "An early RC6 local run timed out on loaded ping with uneven retained storage. Fair cleanup scheduling and repeated speedtest qualification were added before publication."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Ordinary EXPUNGE on Rambler still requires field confirmation. If it stalls, the circuit preserves debt and delivery can continue only within finite retained capacity.",
    "Sustained server-outbound collection requires UIDPLUS APPENDUID ownership proof; missing proof is never refunded.",
    "Local and hosted TLS IMAP models do not qualify real Android/mobile or Rambler performance.",
    "Aggregate old-session debt and append-only discovery logs remain sustained-use limitations.",
    "Manual local capacity resets do not delete provider mail or unlock provider accounts.",
    "The strict ramp, rolling five-second throughput and half-second pause goals still have misses. This candidate passes the mandatory complete-transfer, average-rate and RTT model gates, not every performance goal. All target results and intermediate failures are retained."
  ],
  "installation": "Update both endpoints; server manager option 18 or sudo itom update-from-tmp. Install the signed APK in place preserving app data and profile."
